  "paths": {
    "/rest/product/v3.0/products": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "定义产品",
        "description": "云服务预置产品或者通过页面创建产品。\n\n1. /product/v3.0/products接口只会注册服务的基本信息,不会注册服务的actions(服务发布、上线时可选的审批项)、endpoint(服务目录跳转时路径)、catalog(服务目录分类)、links(云联邦HCS服务目录跳转时路径)等信息。建议使用/rest/product/v3.1/products POST接口。\n\n2. 使用v3.0接口创建服务后,可通过/rest/product/v3.0/support-actions POST接口注册服务审批项。建议使用/rest/product/v3.0/modify-actions POST接口。\n请求示例如下:\n{ \n    \"service_type\":\"ecs\", \n    \"action\":\"apply\", \n    \"region_id\": \"cn-west-1\"\n}\n\n请求响应如下:\n{\n\"result\": true\n}\n\n3. 可通过/rest/product/v3.0/support-actions DELETE接口删除服务审批项。建议使用/rest/product/v3.0/modify-actions POST接口。\n请求示例如下:删除该服务指定的审批项\n/rest/product/v3.0/support-actions?service_type=others-1656319918270&action=apply&region_id=cn-global-137\n\n请求示例如下:删除该服务所有的审批项\n/rest/product/v3.0/support-actions?service_type=others-1656319918270\n\n4. 可通过/rest/product/v3.0/modify-actions POST接口修改服务审批项\n变更类型包括增加(add)、删除(delete),该接口除了会增加或删除服务审批项之外,还会同时增加或删除服务关联的审批流程。 建议使用该方法增加或删除审批项。\n    请求示例如下:\n{ \n\"modify_type\":\"add\", \n\"service_type\":\"others-1656319918270\", \n\"action\":\"apply\", \n\"region_id\": \"cn-global-137\"\n}\n请求示例如下:\n{ \n\"modify_type\":\"delete\", \n\"service_type\":\"others-1656319918270\", \n\"action\":\"apply\", \n\"region_id\": \"cn-global-137\"\n}",
        "x-opseverity": "Minor",
        "x-precautions": "1.错误码:当请求不成功时,响应体内的错误码信息请参见“ManageOne 运营面API参考 > 错误码说明 > 产品管理”章节。\n",
        "x-resource": "定义产品",
        "tags": [
          "产品管理"
        ],
        "operationId": "CreateProduct",
        "produces": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "consumes": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "X-Language",
            "description": "操作发生时的语言环境,中文是zh-cn,英文是en-us。",
            "in": "header",
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "zh-cn",
              "en-us"
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "X-Auth-Token",
            "in": "header",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "description": "机机账户或者运营管理员或者VDC管理员有效的token。"
          },
          {
            "name": "product",
            "description": "待定义的产品信息对象。",
            "in": "body",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/CreateProductVO"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "定义产品成功。",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/ProductResultDTO"
            },
            "examples": {
              "application/json": {
                "product_id": "f038b65254ef48249e304e9a3d870da0"
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "参数错误。"
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "URL鉴权失败。"
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "rest接口未找到。"
          },
          "406": {
            "description": "流控限流。"
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "默认ServiceException异常码,应用内部错误。"
          }
        },
        "x-support-sdk": "N",
        "x-request-examples-url-1": "POST https://{endpoint}/rest/product/v3.0/products",
        "x-request-examples-description-1": "",
        "x-request-examples-1": {
          "name": "{\"zh_CN\":\"ecs product\",\"en_US\":\"ecs product1\"}",
          "description": "{\"zh_CN\":\"description\",\"en_US\":\"description\"}",
          "service_type": "ecs",
          "icon_id": "defaulticonecs",
          "params": "{\"a\":\"111\",\"b\":\"222\"}",
          "is_default": false,
          "region_id": "region1",
          "catalog_id": "1"
        }
      }
    }
  },
